{"script":"yd_005_05","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]唉，刚刚在旅店上班的时候搬了好些货物，现在手臂还是酸的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]帮我揉揉？不用不用，休息一下就好了，这点疲劳不算什么。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]因为水栖属的体质，我的恢复能力很强。就算是扭伤拉伤甚至脱臼，都能很快恢复。[r]就连这双曾经受伤严重的腿，再过个几年也能重新长好了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]难道这也是大家都把工作推给我的原因之一吗……哈哈，应该不会是这样吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]不过……谢谢你的关心。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-熟识2"}